  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163560406-b4178f87-01ab-42c9-acc0-c10c82e295cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地下城與其他結構中現在會生成 Boss，超過 29 種基於原版生物的 Boss 變種</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>這些 Boss 擁有獨特的能力、屬性、戰利品與行為/AI，每一種都是不同的挑戰。<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要安裝 <strong>Cuboard</strong> 依賴模組（較新版本）</a><br><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有 Boss 皆透過資料包創建，預設模組已包含 29 種 Boss。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它們可完全自訂，您也可以輕鬆自行新增 Boss。您可以從幾乎任何實體中製作 Boss，包括其他模組的實體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此查看自訂 Boss 的完整指南：https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395</a></span></p><p><br>測試 Boss 的指令：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>/brutalbosses spawnboss all&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;生成所有 Boss<br>/brutalbosses spawnboss random&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;隨機生成一個 Boss<br>/brutalbosses spawnboss &lt;filename&gt;&nbsp; &nbsp;生成指定 Boss</p>\n</div><p><br><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組與任何包含可掠奪寶箱/容器的結構相容，因為 Boss 會在這些寶箱旁生成。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用原版戰利品表的結構天生相容，其他結構可透過資料包明確添加。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預設包含以下結構模組的相容性：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Awesome Dungeon<br>Awesome Dungeon Edition Ocean</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Awesome dungeon nether<br>Awesome dungeon end</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Bygone Nether<br>Dungeon Crawl<br>Dungeons Enhanced<br>Dungeons Plus<br>End Remastered<br>Goblins &amp; Dungeons<br>Illagers+<br>Infernal Expansion</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>It takes a pillage<br>Mo' Structures</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Phillips ruins<br>Stoneholm, Underground Villages<br>The Graveyard</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>The Lost castle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>Towns and Towers<br>Towers of the Wild: Reloaded<br>Towers of the Wild: Additions<br>Valhelsia Structures<br>When Dungeons Arise</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>William wythers<br>YUNG's Better Dungeons<br>YUNG's Better Strongholds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;缺少某個模組？您可以透過資料包輕鬆添加，請參考 Boss 創建指南中的生成段落：<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395</a><span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有 Boss 列表：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/685/archmageboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/686/blazeboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/687/cavespiderboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/688/drownedboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"630\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/689/endervindicatorboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/690/evokerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/691/evokersummoner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/692/ghastboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/693/guardianboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/694/huskboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/695/irongolemboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/696/madcowboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/697/phantomboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/698/piglinbruteboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/699/pillagerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/700/rabbitboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/701/shulkerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/702/skeletonshieldboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/703/snowgolemboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/704/strayboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/705/vexboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/706/vindicatorboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/707/witchboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/708/witherskeletonrangedboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/709/witherskeletonshieldboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/710/zoglinboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/711/zombieboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/712/zombietoxicboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
